      "elapsed_s": 12.542729000007967,
      "client_cpu_s": 13.233257999999996,
      "transcript": "He tells us that at this festive season of the year, with Christmas and a roast beef looming before us. Similes drawn from eating and its results occur most readily to the mind.",
