      "elapsed_s": 29.54173162500956,
      "client_cpu_s": 36.407284000000004,
      "transcript": "Linelles pictures are a sort of Up guards and Adam paintings And Mason's exquisite idols are as national as a jingo poem. Mister Burke at Foster's landscapes smile at one much in the same way that Mister Carker used to flash his teeth. And Mister John Collier gives his sitter a cheerful slap in the back before he says, like a shampooer in a Turkish bath, next man.",
